.DS_Store
*.pyc
*.egg-info
*.swp
tags
node_modules
__pycache__

# Vite build output for the React frontend (frontend/ -> here). Rebuilt by
# `npm run build`; a committed bundle would conflict on every build and go
# stale against the source beside it.
package-lock.json

# Source documents the app is built against, not part of it. The August 2026
# feed formulations govern every concentrate and TMR BOM here — see
# demo/build_concentrates.py and demo/build_feed_rations.py, which carry the
# figures in code — but the workbooks themselves are revised on the farm and
# do not diff, so they are kept out of the history rather than versioned in it.
references/

# Debug artefacts, not source: browser automation logs and page dumps, and
# the screenshots taken while reviewing a design change. Scoped to the repo
# root and to the automation's own folder — an unanchored *.png would also
# swallow real image assets under public/images, which is a quiet way to lose
# a logo.
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png
